t(1, 930, """Women in the Islamic world have suffered greatly from the private sector's disregard for the privacy of their being and the nature of their deep-rooted customs and traditions .. A woman can only lead a calm, balanced social life, in which she is not tense, in modern, enclosed places .. In the coming age, when most women will not work, the failure to appreciate the importance of women's necessities, the failure to appreciate their necessities and requirements, will remain an unjustified restriction upon them.""")

t(1, 2060, """When we say to an Arab: “Your Ummah will be liberated” ... he falls silent .. he does not speak .. Do you know why he falls silent? Because he drifts off in his imagination .. he finds himself to be this man standing before the Westerner .. Then he comes to and says: “You are a lie .. We are slaves, we will remain slaves and we will die slaves”""")

t(2, 540, """The Ummah is of this height .. Whoever does not see this height and this stature whose name is the Ummah of Islam, like the stature of this man standing overlooking Jerusalem, the symbol of every one of those who believed in the promise of their Lord and trusted their Prophet's promise from his Lord .. whoever does not see all this with open eyes has no doubt grown up a dwarf, lived a dwarf and will die a dwarf""")

