t(8, 2350, """Ignorant people come out before you .. they lie about Allah and His Messenger .. they give fatwas in ignorance .. they speak in ignorance .. more ignorant than ignorance itself .. So do not lean toward them and do not be dragged behind them like one who does not use his mind and does not reflect on the matter of his religion, deviating from the people of knowledge, those firmly grounded in knowledge among the righteous scholars .. The fitnah is great, and the ignorance I have witnessed, which no mind can imagine, from ignorant people speaking about religion and the events of the end of time is truly a frightening and terrifying thing""")

