t(12, 1790, """Before the fall of the Roman state, the Roman people hated their state intensely and wished that anyone from outside would invade them to save them from the state's tyranny .. The reason for the people's hatred of their state was the collapse of the currency centuries earlier, the emergence of the feudal system, discrimination between the classes of the people and the crushing of the poor .. Man is man .. And money .. the loaf of bread .. are important for loyalty to the country to remain .. With hunger loyalty shrinks, then goes .. evaporates .. when a generation comes that carries no moral ideas .. carries no values worth going hungry for!""")

t(13, 530, """In certain regions of the world that may be the poorest .. and in the year of the great war .. if things become severe, do not forget that barter was once a human economic system!""")

t(13, 1690, """A dream in a picture dated years ago (with a correction .. The roundabout was in a city in the seventies era, 1975, with old cars and primitive supermarkets, and the name Faraj was inside the name of Allah, as if the name of Allah, sanctified and exalted, were embracing it in a way that is hard to draw, but in the end it was below the name of Allah the Almighty, and there was nothing of stone under the name Faraj as in the picture) .. This article is connected as a whole .. This article is for the sake of demolishing the fears of this world in hearts; I do not generalize that everyone is afraid .. I am only addressing a general matter .. and the emptying of the heart of dangers that a person fears by his nature and by virtue of his human constitution .. This is an article I ask to be reflected upon, so that those fears are removed from the reader's soul and he knows that Allah the Exalted is with us and closer to us than we imagine, and that the companionship of Allah the Exalted prevails over the whole universe and not on earth alone. In this regard, brothers and sisters contact me, worried about their brother; I thank them all. By Allah, they have carried their brother's concern, and this, by Allah, is from the noble character of all the brothers following here .. But I do not like this worry to remain with any of my brothers and sisters, and this matter must be ended, by Allah's permission .. Several dreams I saw many long years ago, and a great many dreams that were seen for me or sent to me by brothers and sisters as well; and after those dreams I no longer find anything in this world to worry about, so there is no need at all for any kind of worry .. The dream in the picture here can be drawn, but the second cannot .. In the second I was called to the finest platform, of luxurious stone, wide and high, and I was told: "Look upward, because Allah wants to look at you." So I looked upward toward the sky and saw clouds with a light behind them the like of which does not exist in this world and which has nothing of the light of this world; therefore drawing it is impossible, inconceivable and forbidden, not valid and not permissible, indeed disbelief. And I knew in the dream that the One looking at me was our Lord, sanctified be His names, with certainty not doubt, and with complete certainty; sanctified be His names and attributes, exalted is He in the heavens and on earth, most high and great. And I felt a great love and an immense mercy that flooded my soul .. After that nothing remained that could descend into the soul as fear or into the heart as apprehension .. All the fears of this world collapsed entirely .. So I ask the brothers and sisters to know that Allah the Exalted protects us all by His might, His power and His will, and that whoever has descend into his heart the feeling of something about the essence of Allah the Exalted and truly grasps who Allah the Exalted is, with a grasp that unveils to a person a shocking, shaking piece of knowledge that cannot be understood by reflection nor discovered by reading, even in the Book of Allah, because something of the reality of Allah the Almighty has descended, or a great measure of the reality of Allah the Almighty has descended; that descent blows out of the heart people's fears of dangers, because you see Allah in your heart and grasp the reality of His divinity and lordship with the grasp of certainty, not the grasp of reflection and thought.""")

t(14, 85, """So, noble ones, the companionship of Allah the Almighty, our Lord, with His servants, men and women, is realized, actual and occurring. Every person has his stories of his Lord's companionship. Every one of you, if he sits calmly and recalls how many times Allah the Exalted rescued him, how many times He was gentle with him, how many times He saved him, how many times He healed him, how many times He answered his prayer, and in how many matters He mended his brokenness, will discover that what I am speaking of is a reality in the life of each one of you, and the matter is not limited to a particular person. This is your state with your Lord, so no harm comes to us from all the upheavals that befall us .. In the airport transit I was certain of deliverance .. I had no doubt about it, and such is my state in all my circumstances .. So I call on every brother and sister to try, in dangers and hardships, having complete certainty in Allah, so that they see how their deliverance will always be, insha'Allah, in proportion to their certainty .. What we want today in our Ummah is to raise the level of this certainty and make it real and effective upon the soul, behavior and reactions .. Even in the darkest moments and the most dangerous situations, such as wars, as is happening in our Strip and in our Sudan, certainty remains the best thing a person can carry with him at every moment .. This long post is an account of dreams that left their mark on the soul and strengthened certainty, and of an experience that made known the greatness of the Lord of the heavens and the earth and of what we know and do not know. But your own experiences of Allah's protection of you must also leave their mark on you and be your light with which you always illuminate the darkness of rugged, desolate roads. Each of you has his own tale, his story, his certainty and Allah the Exalted's love for him.""")

h(14, 1200, """Allah — Faraj""")

t(14, 1705, """An injustice taking place around the world in transit halls .. an injustice people do not see .. Bangladeshi and Pakistani nationals in East Asia are in a difficult situation at airports""")

t(15, 300, """Their right over you is forever .. "And say: My Lord, have mercy on them as they raised me when I was small" .. Whoever does not pray for his parents in his prostration has not known Allah's right nor obeyed Him .. Someone will ask me: "Even if they wronged me?" Yes, even if they wronged you with a wrong beyond the bounds of reason .. Do not cut off your prayer for them, living or dead""")

t(15, 1485, """In the summer of 1996, month 7, when the temperature at night was 40 and the humidity very high .. Hamriya Mosque, Dubai .. The experience .. Dear young man .. It is not important that you suffer at the start of your life .. What matters is that you learn from suffering .. that suffering builds in you rather than demolishes .. Seeking cold air beneath the mosque door, as the mosque's air conditioners ran all night but the doors were locked, is a form of adapting to reality .. Adapting to the problem when it is bigger than your means .. and bigger than your weakness .. Problems must be assessed with rationality, calm, understanding, awareness and wisdom""")

t(16, 185, """The gate of Christ College, 1993, India .. A person is not born at the age of 18 .. So my advice to my young brothers .. Do not try to take off the garment of your heritage and upbringing .. you will not succeed! Your history is your future .. and your past is what is coming in your life!""")

t(16, 1365, """It seems the gate of heaven was open at that moment .. We live very ordinary moments .. The one sitting beside you may ask you a question and you give an answer, and it is as if it rises to heaven at the speed of the soul's ascent .. How did life pass by? Certain moments cannot be erased from a person's memory! Not everyone who cannot see with his eyes is unable to do something useful .. May Allah have mercy on a sheikh who has passed on .. Blind, he offered good .. If only among those with eyes there were some who see as that man saw!""")

t(17, 60, """Allah's mercy be upon you, Sheikh Ibrahim .. O son of Desouk .. He who taught people how to recite the Book of Allah, what could he carry with him to his Lord more beautiful than a deed like this""")

t(17, 1210, """The signposts of the road are clear early on, by degrees .. but we do not understand! Because had we understood, we would have suffered very early""")

t(17, 2275, """It was never evil .. Let it be contemplation .. Let pain be stillness .. rejection be building .. banishment be ascent .. and estrangement be arrival .. Let the story always be so, as long as it has been written and there is no escape from it""")

t(18, 890, """The journey alone is neither an evil nor a punishment""")

t(18, 1945, """“You alone are my daughter .. The one on the floor I do not love .. She is from another wife I do not love .. I love you because I love your mother” .. Homes of injustice and oppression, and children who deserve rescue!""")
